人机导弹发射场进行先发制人的打击。 俄罗斯也在继续袭击乌克兰，造成扎波罗热和第聂伯罗彼得罗夫斯克部分地区断电。 （美联社）"},"tg":{"media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/s9w48R-J4tenEWR-8qhTQDfvP1lZJ3ufTtVPFTFkm1xpmUJJv9AFOyjmK9-jyCfz5IqpG6gA_nv42_Ml_HYphDM3zYEWlseWCOihrHHal4RAky18GUqkpDv058Wabgra67N140xkSE5jnkEBqPr24j8ODo9bLZG1s2h3Bf6pC99plzDeK5l-xfvX9gHODic0_c4lGtfjK9vq-vL6Khi8_xzYmMKpvARWpvVRBrFzubpvLIcm2YDbGLjMAd4uGxucaCqNByYkmDeYl8tCVJC6N7xg1fJwKpFSak9TR3Wud3jO_gVGHo4UN_ugHs2cwxcwoVZ8tFnsYg8QSpgrNILvaw.jpg"}],"views":26800,"views_label":"26.8K","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T15:06:58+08:00"}},{"id":"freechinese:113414","kind":"news","channel":"current","source_id":"freechinese","source_name":"FREE 中文","title":"红毯铺设机","summary":"这项发明在国际上真遥遥领先","url":"https://t.me/freechinese/113414","image":{"url":"media/freechinese/113414_1.webp","width":180,"height":320},"published_at":"2026-11-17T21:56:14+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T15:12:25+08:00","lang":"zh","translated":false,"body":"红毯铺设机\n\n这项发明在国际上真遥遥领先","tg":{"media":[{"type":"video","url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/298688c16b.mp4?token=hZcEtp1gS6uxaoawWQMhM0rKz7zWHPA5hJvpL6hK5IVVbm7tI5_wXo_WrRE50NhJe7gm3tPLblZIkHx_KXxvQE0O93orxVe7thc0Ocafkmo4M2Uoplv1eBiAqENwvphj6kZrgflRnHE4T2VvlHsIcA9yON5A7y1CyqMZdb4FFA6qtKeUWvFFn5QmigMMOGqH_AbNDhHcytzR1oKWTVLaVMGJkrcjHJthMtu-C-JhBgWniv_8NprU2zE3nzPrTz0ksS2OZEffB3Y0ZlwRQIAN3G9AIMj-b3u7ACEY-g19_KHea11Ucf2-5ZEbS-yDvE9rI1LAz3oRVjI3TNM_0jLqzg","preview_url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/pzUA7JRUENZS2lWvQ1cGlhXsGDygl9wAhuKRgqU0oi0QU4Pf2Ujr-rAVcdbwFv-tLag0tgQDsvPfwAhtXTVs5uo6GM15pY6wDcemCx4ftl83o-Shs5D4kiwdMw7Xw-FXOyzNPlvtCxIZNxrG4q3wTuTd2_Eunzoqe91FYNgvya6qwhc0OSoSwvX8Q5lZoSe_wmu4jOHQDs4h8fbvdLdl_EnrwmpDIzJTj63VIXKdHFqSAkLuhYY9AowjyBTqep_TX5qoAa-c_IODx_-Tacf44w5MMzMAZSA429DZ38mbvT2aSkFXPrQ3WiNG3RelEwIN5q2sgeTxczbx5muL4iG6Hw"}],"views":2030,"views_label":"2.03K","reactions":[{"emoji":"💩","count":38,"label":"38"},{"emoji":"👍","count":6,"label":"6"},{"emoji":"🤪","count":3,"label":"3"},{"emoji":"❤","count":1,"label":"1"},{"emoji":